* Differential Amplifier Circuit

Q1 2 1 3 PNP
Q2 5 4 3 PNP

R1 1 6 2k
R2 5 7 2k
R3 3 0 4.3k

V1 6 0 DC 5V
V2 8 0 DC -5V

Vb1 2 0 DC vb1_value
Vb2 5 0 DC vb2_value

*Net definitions:
* Node 1: vb1
* Node 2: Base of Q1 
* Node 3: Emitter of Q1 and Q2 (common)
* Node 4: Base of Q2
* Node 5: Collector of Q2
* Node 6: +5V
* Node 7: vo (output)
* Node 8: -5V

.end